      166.97,
      368.37,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2Registration of Electors (Special Provisions)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.73,
      397.22,
      296.03
    ],
    "text": "shall on proof of the matters specified in paragraphs (a), (b)and (c) and on production of a certificate issued by the GramaNiladhari of the area in which he is presently residing to theeffect that he is an internally displaced person, be entitled toapply to the registering officer of the electoral destrict withinwhich he was permanently resident prior to May 18, 2009, tobe registered in the register of electors of such electoraldistrict.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      308.09,
      397.18,
      342.83
    ],
    "text": "(2) The application referred to in subsection (1), shall bemade on or before the date specified by the Commissioner ofElections by notice published in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      354.89,
      397.19,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "(3) Notwithstanding the provisions of subsection (1), theentitlement granted under that subsection shall be extendedto the children of a citizen referred to in subsection (1) \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      401.69,
      397.19,
      436.43
    ],
    "text": "(a) who had not attained the age of eighteen years onthe date on which such citizen became an internallydisplaced person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.87,
      448.49,
      397.19,
      494.87
    ],
    "text": "(b) who were born after such citizen became aninternally displaced person and have attained theage of eighteen years or more on the date ofoperations if this Act; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      176.71,
      506.93,
      397.16,
      530.03
    ],
    "text": "(c) whose name has not been entered in any register inoperation subsequent to the year 2009,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      542.09,
      397.21,
      588.47
    ],
    "text": "on production of the birth certificate of such child sought tobe registered and a certificate issued by the Grama Niladhariof the area in which he is presently residing on proof of thematters specified in paragraphs (a) or (b) and (c) above.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      600.53,
      397.2,
      670.55
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The registering officer shall prepare a list of namesof persons referred to in section 2 and shall give notice in theGazette and in at least one newspaper each in the Sinhalese,English and Tamil languages that such list has been completedand is open for inspection at all reasonable hours of the dayat the office of the registering officer.",
    "fonts": [
