      202.97,
      401.9,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) (a) Any person who has applied to be registered in nyregister of electors for any electoral district in the NorthernProvince or Eastern Province and whose name has notappeared in the list referred to in subsection (1) may appealin writing to the registering officer within one week of thenotice published in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.87,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) The provisions of subsection (8) to (16) of section 14of the Registration of Electors Act, No. 44 of 1980 shallmutatis mutandis apply to appeals against decisions of theregistering offecer.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.9,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) If upon such appeal and inquiry, the registering officerdecides not to include the name of such appellant in theSupplementary Register referred to in section 4, the aggrievedappellant may appeal to the revising officer within one weekof the decision of the registering offecer and the provisionsof subsection (2) to (5) of section 15 of the Registration ofElectors Act, No. 44 of 1980 shall mutatis mutandis apply toan appeal made under this paragraph.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.97,
      401.9,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "4.The registering officer of each Electoral District shallprepare and certify a Supplementary Register containingthe names of the persons whose names appear in the listprepared under section 3 after inquiry and adjudication ifany, and finalize such Register in terms of that section:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      526.97,
      401.89,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "Provided that the registering officer may certify theSupplementary Register during the pendency of an appealto the revising officer and shall thereafter enter in, or expungefrom, such Register, the name of any person in accordancewith the decision of the revising officer on the determinationof such appeal.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      610.97,
      401.9,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) No person whose name appears in theSupplementary Register shall be entitled to have his nameentered in any other register of electors notwithstandingthat he may be qualified to have his name entered in two ormore registers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      455.83,
      455.86,
      474.5
    ],
    "text": "SupplementaryRegister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      611.11,
      441.57,
      620.18
    ],
    "text": "Offences.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
